OL,3,APoundland owner in crunch talks as
OL,4,Aretailer's collapse looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon Brothers said it is "pursuing
OL,7,Fall avenues through the sales process"
OL,8,Fbut that Poundland has faced several
OL,9,Fyears of instability and "remains
OL,10,Fchallenged and vulnerable".
